 68828  Push "NAVTEXT"
 68833  GetMember
 68834  Push 7, "The car that Felicity tried to use to escape. Veradux shot it with an Electro-Bolt to shut off the engine and stop her from getting away, but it looks like the battery was permanently damaged. In the car there was a tape player. I still can't believe it... How is that song going to help me with anything? Maybe Louis gave me the wrong tape. Better keep it anyway, just in case. Felicity seemed to think it was important."
