 69066  Push 11, "There are rising concerns over the disappearance of the renowned magician, Clemons Bugiel. He has been reported missing for over three weeks, and the authorities have had no luck in their search. Bugiel is a world famous illusionist, known for his tricks that include disguise, mirage, and hypnosis. He was last seen at his magic show 'The Floating Apple' before vanishing without a trace. Is this another one of his tricks, or is for real? The authorities fear the worst."
