 69712  Push 1, "You leveled up in the previous battle! As a result, you were rewarded 1 Ability Point to develop your character with, and several Stat Points. You may access these using the 'Abilities' button. If you are unhappy with the way you have distributed your points, you can press the 'Re-Spec' button, and your points will be reset (at a cost)."
