 69886  Push 4, "If you press the 'Map' button, you can see all the Zones available in 'Sonny 2.' Once you have completed all the battles in a Zone, it will allow you to go to other Zones that are connected to it. Zones that you cannot access will appear grey, and ones which you can access will appear blue."
