 73041  Push "SHOP"
 73047  GetMember
 73048  Push 0, "I got what you need mate. Except soap. Someone's taken all the soap. That's why it always stinks around here. But don't worry mate, you'll get used to it."
 73063  SetMember
 73064  Push "KrinLang"
 73069  GetVariable
 73070  Push "ENGLISH"
 73075  GetMember
 73076  Push "SHOP"
 73082  GetMember
 73083  Push 1, "Sssh! Keep your voices down, lads. We're amongst enemies here. In fact, I don't even know if I can trust you. Just buy what you need and leave."
 73094  SetMember
 73095  Push "KrinLang"
 73100  GetVariable
 73101  Push "ENGLISH"
 73106  GetMember
 73107  Push "SHOP"
 73113  GetMember
 73114  Push 2, "Listen. I'm a collector of antique artifacts, and I usually don't sell what I find, but since we're in tough financial times... Consider yourself lucky."
 73125  SetMember
 73126  Push "KrinLang"
 73131  GetVariable
 73132  Push "ENGLISH"
 73137  GetMember
 73138  Push "SHOP"
 73144  GetMember
 73145  Push 3, "I'm fine, I'm fine! My nose is bleeding a little but I'll be alright. You need any more gear? I've got another suitcase of things for you to buy."
