 74025  Push 0, "Wild and animalistic, the Biological line harnesses its power from strength and speed. You have the choice of ripping your prey apart with advanced physical combat, or melting them down with your toxic arsenal of poisons. This is probably the most straightforward class to play. Recommended for beginners."
 74040  SetMember
 74041  Push "KrinLang"
 74046  GetVariable
 74047  Push "ENGLISH"
 74052  GetMember
 74053  Push "CLASSDESCRIPT"
 74059  GetMember
 74060  Push 2, "Strong and stable, the Hydraulic line derives its power from its mastery of water. You can use it to bolster your physical strength, or channel it against the enemy to bring about their icy doom. Wielding such powers allows you greater control over the battle, as well as powerful survival and team support options."
 74071  SetMember
 74072  Push "KrinLang"
 74077  GetVariable
 74078  Push "ENGLISH"
 74083  GetMember
 74084  Push "CLASSDESCRIPT"
 74090  GetMember
 74091  Push 1, "If insanity were a weapon, then this would be its form. The Psychological line is heavily based on directly attacking the enemy’s mind. The abilities you have available are often quite situational, but some of the most powerful. You may betray or even sacrifice your friends if you let the darkness consume you. "
