139153  Push "ENGLISH"
139158  GetMember
139159  Push "MANUAL"
139170  GetMember
139171  Push 0, "How do I play?"
139199  SetMember
139200  Push "KrinLang"
139205  GetVariable
139206  Push "ENGLISH"
139211  GetMember
139212  Push "MANUALEX"
139225  GetMember
139226  Push 0, "You can just start a new game right now! Make sure that you have the tutorial level enabled. All the basics will be explained within the first few fights. Just listen to the dialogue and read the text. But if you insist on reading... Sonny is a turn based fighting game. You choose what move your character makes in his turn by first selecting WHO you want to make a move on, and then you can choose WHAT you want to do to that target. For example, if you want to attack an enemy, you click on the enemy first, then you can choose to attack him. If you want to heal a team mate, select that character and you will be able to choose a move to use on him. You may only have 8 moves 'equipped' in any fight, and you configure this from your Abilities menu. Some moves can be equipped more than once, so that you can use it more often."
140071  SetMember
140072  Push "KrinLang"
140077  GetVariable
140078  Push "ENGLISH"
140083  GetMember
140084  Push "MANUAL"
140095  GetMember
140096  Push 1, "What do the colors on the buffs and numbers mean?"
140155  SetMember
140156  Push "KrinLang"
140161  GetVariable
140162  Push "ENGLISH"
140167  GetMember
140168  Push "MANUALEX"
140181  GetMember
140182  Push 1, "They just indicate the element that the ability is classified as: Physical, Cosmic, Fire, Ice, Lightning, Earth, Shadow, and Poison."
140324  SetMember
140325  Push "KrinLang"
140330  GetVariable
140331  Push "ENGLISH"
140336  GetMember
140337  Push "MANUAL"
140348  GetMember
140349  Push 2, "Team Control"
140371  SetMember
140372  Push "KrinLang"
140377  GetVariable
140378  Push "ENGLISH"
140383  GetMember
140384  Push "MANUALEX"
140397  GetMember
140398  Push 2, "During battle, you can cannot directly control the actions of your team mates, but you can tell them how to behave. You can also equip your team mates with items and weapons, by going into the inventory screen."
140618  SetMember
140619  Push "KrinLang"
140624  GetVariable
140625  Push "ENGLISH"
140630  GetMember
140631  Push "MANUAL"
140642  GetMember
140643  Push 3, "What does each stat do?"
140676  SetMember
140677  Push "KrinLang"
140682  GetVariable
140683  Push "ENGLISH"
140688  GetMember
140689  Push "MANUALEX"
140702  GetMember
140703  Push 3, "Strength and Instinct are just co-efficients for your abilities. Speed is also a co-efficient, but to only a few abilities. Speed also increases your critical strike chance and dodge/accuracy. Vitality increases your Health. Piercing increases critical strike chance, and Defense decreases damage taken."
141016  SetMember
141017  Push "KrinLang"
141022  GetVariable
141023  Push "ENGLISH"
141028  GetMember
141029  Push "MANUAL"
141040  GetMember
141041  Push 4, "Help! I am stuck on a level!"
141079  SetMember
141080  Push "KrinLang"
141085  GetVariable
141086  Push "ENGLISH"
141091  GetMember
141092  Push "MANUALEX"
141105  GetMember
141106  Push 4, "It's mainly about the Strategy and Abilities that you use. Observe the enemy carefully, and look into your entire Ability tree to find ways to beat them. If you need more help, then try visiting the Sonny forums on ArmorGames for guides and walkthroughs."
